# Build-context filter for apps/api/Dockerfile ONLY (BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile; the context is the repo
# root). Keeps host artefacts out of the image: the host's node_modules
# (the image installs its own), a developer's .env, and any local sqlite file.
# The image needs only package.json, packages/shared and apps/api.

**/node_modules
**/.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/data
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.log
**/coverage
**/dist
apps/web
apps/api/test
docs
scripts
